2E FORTH OS V0.5

A DIRECT-THREADED 6502 FORTH FOR THE
APPLE //E, WITH A 560X192 MONOCHROME
DOUBLE HI-RES DRIVER AND A POINTER-DRIVEN
WINDOWING ENVIRONMENT.

THE DESKTOP EXPLORER READS THIS DISK'S
DOS 3.3 CATALOG THROUGH RWTS.

IJKL  MOVE POINTER
SPACE CLICK / SELECT
T     TOGGLE LOCK
M     READ JOYSTICK
Q     LEAVE THE EVENT LOOP

